cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this exact finite threshold-return archive, please cite Ta-Yoshua Lubuimi."
title: "Lubuimi Kolaz / Collatz Threshold-Return Archive"
authors:
  - family-names: "Lubuimi"
    given-names: "Ta-Yoshua"
date-released: 2026-11-10
version: "0.1.0"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Exact integer computations of first-return excursions above thresholds
  B=31, 63, 127 and 255 for the accelerated odd Syracuse map, including
  complete finite tables and verified common terminal suffixes. This archive
  records finite computations only and does not claim a proof of the global
  Collatz conjecture.
repository-code: "https://github.com/s4ztz4bnf6-maker/Lubuimi"
keywords:
  - "Collatz conjecture"
  - "Syracuse map"
  - "threshold returns"
  - "finite excursion"
  - "confluence"
  - "integer computation"
